  "title": "Pickle Brine Chicken",
  "description": "Use pickle brine in Chef John's recipe for tender chicken breasts soaked in leftover pickle juice, sugar, salt, and cayenne, then grilled until juicy.",
  "authors": [
    "John Mitzewich"
  ],
